<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Automotive Services Co cuts 1966 losses.</title>
<headline>Saudi Automotive Services Co cuts 1966 losses.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net loss		  9.1    vs   16.4 loss</p>
<p> Sales income	  106.4    vs   90.1</p>
<p> Expenses		133.6    vs  121.5</p>
<p> Shareholers' funds  353.5    vs  362.6</p>
<p> Assets		  426.6    vs  441.7</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Automotive Services Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based company is traded on the Saudi Stock market.</p>
</text>
